# Camera positions saved by the Tank AI work session.
#
# Each entry is the `cam=` line verbatim from nuTerra's Set Cam Position
# button, which writes C:\ProgramData\nuTerra\cam.txt. That file is
# overwritten by the next press and by any other session pressing it, so
# anything worth keeping is copied here.
#
# To use one, paste the cam= line onto the command line as it stands:
#
#   nuTerra.exe 19_monastery cam=<line> perteam=15 tanks ai=1
#
# Signed per DIRECTIVES.md rule 9 - the session that saved it and the date.


## sim-overwatch  -  19_monastery
# The owner set this one while we were looking at the tank sim: the two bases
# and the lanes between them, from above the team 2 end. Kept because the sim
# is judged by eye and comparing two runs means looking at them from the same
# place - a different camera is a different picture of the same behaviour.
#
# Saved 2026-09-13 by Tank AI work, set by mikeoverbay.
cam=-45.6497,0.9564,-0.589,-10.4261,0,414.647
map=19_monastery
sun=-1782.5,682.8,450.1
